<title>ITALY: Thomson, Matra not part of Finmeccanica/GEC deal.</title>
<headline>Thomson, Matra not part of Finmeccanica/GEC deal.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joint ventures involving Britain's General Electric Co Plc and France's Thomson-CSF and Matra will not be included in the joint venture announced on Thursday between GEC and Finmeccanica, Italy's Finmeccanica said.</p>
<p>The planned deal between the British and Italian groups will involve all the activities of Finmeccanica's Alenia Defence unit and a large part of GEC-Marconi's operations.</p>
<p>&quot;It will not include the joint venture with Thomson on sonar or with Matra for space, communications and ship building,&quot; Finmeccanica said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
